1604
00:54:33,338 --> 00:54:36,140
And the colored girls
go doot doo doo--

1605
00:54:36,140 --> 00:54:40,145
oh, wow.
This is a crazy pad.

1606
00:54:40,145 --> 00:54:41,445
Aren’t you lost,
buddy?

1607
00:54:41,445 --> 00:54:44,348
Oh, man.
This sure is.

1608
00:54:44,348 --> 00:54:45,817
Really?
Come on in.

1609
00:54:45,817 --> 00:54:46,885
Can I get you anything?

1610
00:54:46,885 --> 00:54:49,053
Now,
wait a minute.

1611
00:54:49,053 --> 00:54:50,055
What is this?

1612
00:54:50,055 --> 00:54:51,088
Hmm?

1613
00:54:51,088 --> 00:54:52,090
Look,
I don’t want nothin’

1614
00:54:52,090 --> 00:54:53,190
from you, dad,
I really don’t.

1615
00:54:53,190 --> 00:54:54,458
She owes me a fin.
That’s all.

1616
00:54:54,458 --> 00:54:55,893
And I thought it’d
be nice to have.

1617
00:54:55,893 --> 00:54:57,495
And the colored girls
go doot doo doo--

1618
00:54:57,495 --> 00:54:58,563
what are you talking about?

1619
00:54:58,563 --> 00:54:59,663
Don’t sweat,
dad.

1620
00:54:59,663 --> 00:55:00,798
I don’t want
nothin’ from you.

1621
00:55:00,798 --> 00:55:02,200
She owes me a fin.
That’s all.

1622
00:55:02,200 --> 00:55:03,435
Uh, in english,
please.

1623
00:55:03,435 --> 00:55:05,937
I don’t dig with you,
freaky lactose man.

1624
00:55:05,937 --> 00:55:08,840
Wow. You sure have
a nice pad, dad.

1625
00:55:08,840 --> 00:55:10,442
Now, look.
I don’t mean to be rude,

1626
00:55:10,442 --> 00:55:11,910
but you’ll either
have to tell me

1627
00:55:11,910 --> 00:55:13,545
what you’re talkin’ about,
or get outta here.

1628
00:55:13,545 --> 00:55:15,047
Look. The blonde.
The one with the...

1629
00:55:15,047 --> 00:55:16,113
Buick?

1630
00:55:16,113 --> 00:55:17,582
She owes me some bread.
That’s all.

1631
00:55:17,582 --> 00:55:18,950
It’s nothing
to get bugged about.

1632
00:55:18,950 --> 00:55:20,418
What she does here
is your business.

1633
00:55:20,418 --> 00:55:21,853
Hmm.

1634
00:55:21,853 --> 00:55:23,788
I can see you dig me,
dad.

1635
00:55:23,788 --> 00:55:24,855
Look.
I motored this chick,

1636
00:55:24,855 --> 00:55:25,923
vi mason,
over to the island.

1637
00:55:25,923 --> 00:55:28,125
- I got a boat.
- A gravy boat.

1638
00:55:28,125 --> 00:55:29,660
Now, when she asked
me if i’d take her,

1639
00:55:29,660 --> 00:55:30,728
well,
I say okay,

1640
00:55:30,728 --> 00:55:32,397
