a beer back, bartender.

1691
00:57:06,992 --> 00:57:08,460
[Laughs]
Some light beach fare.

1692
00:57:08,460 --> 00:57:10,362
Mm-hmm.

1693
00:57:10,362 --> 00:57:12,730
There you are.

1694
00:57:12,730 --> 00:57:13,798
Plenty of pickles?

1695
00:57:13,798 --> 00:57:16,067
Yes, siree.
Plenty of pickles.

1696
00:57:16,067 --> 00:57:20,338
Hey.
We’re dressed alike.

1697
00:57:20,338 --> 00:57:21,405
So,
how’s life

1698
00:57:21,405 --> 00:57:22,940
