little girl?

1699
00:57:22,940 --> 00:57:24,408
[Laughs]

1700
00:57:26,543 --> 00:57:27,612
Here we are.

1701
00:57:27,612 --> 00:57:29,447
Tumbler of scotch,
and a menu.

1702
00:57:29,447 --> 00:57:30,982
Anything else?

1703
00:57:30,982 --> 00:57:32,417
How are you,
mrs. Ellis?

1704
00:57:32,417 --> 00:57:33,752
Warm,
mr. Nelson.

1705
00:57:33,752 --> 00:57:35,487
It’s a very warm day.

1706
00:57:35,487 --> 00:57:36,787
I think i’ll have
something light.

1707
00:57:36,787 --> 00:57:37,855
Like pork ribs.

1708
00:57:37,855 --> 00:57:39,157
Um,
egg salad sandwich,

1709
00:57:39,157 --> 00:57:41,358
