1738
00:58:31,742 --> 00:58:33,545
Shouldn’t you
be at the rehearsal?

1739
00:58:33,545 --> 00:58:37,148
Holy cow.
Charge it, mr. Nelson.

1740
00:58:37,148 --> 00:58:39,417
You know,
mr. Nelson,

1741
00:58:39,417 --> 00:58:41,485
I wish I could have
my sight back,

1742
